    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the distant future <i>Ghosts of Ancient Io</i> centers around two main characters: The Professor whom you play and your friend The Doctor whom you eventually find and rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Using an ancient mining pod you navigate the ancient moon in search of your friends and the way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653180/extras/8daeb3b8cedd000f31f7862cdb42cc72.avif?t=1747495588\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the ancient interior of Jupiter\u2019s moon Io.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653180/extras/bba9d3a200bb89c11d13e100c98d6b16.avif?t=1747495588\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver both your pod and your mind past unique puzzles as you work your way to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653180/extras/f48ff0ec9ee3ae324ea3bda5d942e917.avif?t=1747495588\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet both the dangerous and the friendly life that\u2019s evolved to live inside the caverns of the hostile moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653180/extras/30e1ef46ef168550a7f3941d8809fdd6.avif?t=1747495588\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge what you can from the ancient mining outpost or exploit the strange alien ecosystem to get what you need to carry on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653180/extras/ded10831e265b0c7bfb1806bdba8a745.avif?t=1747495588\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ghosts of Ancient Io</i> is a chill arcade-like experience with no complex inventory management or elaborate quests to complete. It\u2019s a great game for content creators who don\u2019t typically game but would like to add that experience to their live streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player are invited to enjoy:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels of difficulty for all play levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content suitable for all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission clock for those that like to test themselves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the distant future <i>Ghosts of Ancient Io</i> centers around two main characters: The Professor whom you play and your friend The Doctor whom you eventually find and rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Using an ancient mining pod you navigate the ancient moon in search of your friends and the way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653180/extras/8daeb3b8cedd000f31f7862cdb42cc72.avif?t=1747495588\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the ancient interior of Jupiter\u2019s moon Io.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653180/extras/bba9d3a200bb89c11d13e100c98d6b16.avif?t=1747495588\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver both your pod and your mind past unique puzzles as you work your way to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653180/extras/f48ff0ec9ee3ae324ea3bda5d942e917.avif?t=1747495588\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet both the dangerous and the friendly life that\u2019s evolved to live inside the caverns of the hostile moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653180/extras/30e1ef46ef168550a7f3941d8809fdd6.avif?t=1747495588\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge what you can from the ancient mining outpost or exploit the strange alien ecosystem to get what you need to carry on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653180/extras/ded10831e265b0c7bfb1806bdba8a745.avif?t=1747495588\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ghosts of Ancient Io</i> is a chill arcade-like experience with no complex inventory management or elaborate quests to complete. It\u2019s a great game for content creators who don\u2019t typically game but would like to add that experience to their live streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player are invited to enjoy:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels of difficulty for all play levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content suitable for all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission clock for those that like to test themselves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Who are the Ghosts of Ancient Io? You\u2019ll find out when a chill intergalactic trip turns into a slightly retro single-player platform survival adventure filled with puzzles to solve, aliens to befriend, and a giant fire-breathing slug named Ember.",
